            <ArticleTitle>Co9 S8 /MoS2 Yolk-Shell Spheres for Advanced Li/Na Storage.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/smll.201603490</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Uniform sized Co9 S8 /MoS2 yolk-shell spheres with an average diameter of about 500 nm have been synthesized by a facile route. When evaluated as anodes for lithium-ion and sodium-ion batteries, these Co9 S8 /MoS2 yolk-shell spheres show high specific capacities, excellent rate capabilities, and good cycling stability.</AbstractText>
